# OMS nav: queue jobs + current user

## Queue jobs status
- Background bulk notify / email jobs show in the **top nav** (`fo-nav-right`), **left of** the avatar / user menu — never in the bulk-actions toolbar.
- Component: `app/components/freight/NavQueueJobs.tsx`
- Click Queue chip → popup explains what Queue is + live send log (recipients).
- State lives in `FreightDashboard` (`backgroundJobId`, `queueJob`, localStorage key `bulkNotifyJobId`).
- Do not re-add a "Sending…" chip next to Bulk Actions.

## Current user / avatar
- **Embedded admin** (`app._index`, `app.order_*`): resolve via `currentUserFromSession(session)` in `app/lib/current-user.server.ts` (Session `firstName`/`lastName`/`email`, else shop label). Pass `noteAuthor={currentUser.noteAuthor}` and `<NavUserAvatar … />`.
- **External report dashboard** (`apps.containerdoor.dashboard`): keep existing `UserMenu` + report-auth user. Do not replace with hardcoded `SP`.
- Never hardcode avatar initials like `"SP"` on OMS pages.

## Don't churn
- Leave existing UserMenu / report logout flow alone unless asked.
- Only move/add nav queue + dynamic user wiring; don't redesign unrelated OMS chrome.
